- Use `db.transaction()` for atomicity
- When `data.brands` is NOT provided (undefined), skip brand modification entirely
- Follow the exact error handling patterns used in existing routes
- The `upsertProfile` function already handles undefined vs null semantics (undefined = preserve existing)

